msgstr "If true, then  common naziv (CN) field od S/MIME certifikati will be prefilled s informacije gathered iz  system,\n         e.g., iz  e-pošta postavke od  desktop ili, na Windows, iz  aktivan direktorij."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (prefillSourcesCN), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:29
#, kde-format
msgid "Sources for prefilling CN"
msgstr "Sources za prefilling CN"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (prefillSourcesCN), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This setting specifies from which sources (and with what precedence) the "
"common name (CN) field of newly generated S/MIME certificate signing "
"requests (CSR) shall be prefilled. KEMailSettings uses the name of the "
"desktop's email settings. WinGetUserName (Windows-only) uses the NameDisplay "
"value returned by GetUserNameEx or the value returned by GetUserName. "
"EnvEmail uses the name part of the EMAIL environment variable. ADDisplayName "
"(Windows-only) uses the display name attribute (displayName) retrieved from "
"the Active Directory server. ADFirstNameLastName (Windows-only) uses the "
"first name (givenName) and last name (sn) attributes retrieved from the "
"Active Directory server."
msgstr "ovaj postavka specifies iz which sources (i s what precedence)  common naziv (CN) field od novo generated S/MIME certifikat potpisivanje requests (CSR) shall be prefilled. KEMailSettings uses  naziv od  desktop's e-pošta postavke. WinGetUserName (Windows-only) uses  NameDisplay value vraćeno prema GetUserNameEx ili  value vraćeno prema GetUserName. EnvEmail uses  naziv part od  e-pošta environment variable. ADDisplayName (Windows-only) uses  display naziv attribute (displayName) retrieved iz  aktivan direktorij server. ADFirstNameLastName (Windows-only) uses  first naziv (givenName) i last naziv (sn) attributes retrieved iz  aktivan direktorij server."

