"server."
msgstr "ovaj postavka specifies iz which sources (i s what precedence)  adresa e-pošte field od novo generated OpenPGP certifikati i S/MIME certifikat potpisivanje requests (CSR) shall be prefilled. KEMailSettings uses  adresa e-pošte od  desktop's e-pošta postavke. WinGetUserName (Windows-only) uses  NameUserPrincipal value vraćeno prema GetUserNameEx. EnvEmail uses  adresa e-pošte od  e-pošta environment variable. ADMail (Windows-only) uses  mail attribute (mail) retrieved iz  aktivan direktorij server."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (emailRegex), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:65
#, kde-format
