msgstr "Label za naziv"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (prefillName), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:90
#, kde-format
msgid "Prefill NAME automatically"
msgstr "Prefill naziv automatically"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (prefillName), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:92
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If true, then the name field of OpenPGP certificates will be prefilled with "
"information gathered from the system,\n"
"         e.g., from the email settings of the desktop or, on Windows, from "
"the Active Directory."
msgstr "If true, then  naziv field od OpenPGP certifikati will be prefilled s informacije gathered iz  system,\n         e.g., iz  e-pošta postavke od  desktop ili, na Windows, iz  aktivan direktorij."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (prefillSourcesName), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:96
#, kde-format
msgid "Sources for prefilling name"
msgstr "Sources za prefilling naziv"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (prefillSourcesName), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:97
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This setting specifies from which sources (and with what precedence) the "
"name field of newly generated OpenPGP certificates shall be prefilled. "
"KEMailSettings uses the name of the desktop's email settings. WinGetUserName "
"(Windows-only) uses the NameDisplay value returned by GetUserNameEx or the "
"value returned by GetUserName. EnvEmail uses the name part of the EMAIL "
"environment variable. ADDisplayName (Windows-only) uses the display name "
"attribute (displayName) retrieved from the Active Directory server. "
"ADFirstNameLastName (Windows-only) uses the first name (givenName) and last "
"name (sn) attributes retrieved from the Active Directory server."
msgstr "ovaj postavka specifies iz which sources (i s what precedence)  naziv field od novo generated OpenPGP certifikati shall be prefilled. KEMailSettings uses  naziv od  desktop's e-pošta postavke. WinGetUserName (Windows-only) uses  NameDisplay value vraćeno prema GetUserNameEx ili  value vraćeno prema GetUserName. EnvEmail uses  naziv part od  e-pošta environment variable. ADDisplayName (Windows-only) uses  display naziv attribute (displayName) retrieved iz  aktivan direktorij server. ADFirstNameLastName (Windows-only) uses  first naziv (givenName) i last naziv (sn) attributes retrieved iz  aktivan direktorij server."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (nameRegex), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:101
#, kde-format
msgid "Regex for NAME"
msgstr "Regex za naziv"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (nameRegex), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:102
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This text will be used as pattern validator for the name field of OpenPGP "
"certificates."
msgstr "ovaj tekst will be used as pattern validator za  naziv field od OpenPGP certifikati."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (name), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:106
#, kde-format
msgid "Value of NAME"
msgstr "Value od naziv"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (name), group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:107
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Prefilled value for the name field of OpenPGP certificates. This will "
"override NAME_prefill. It is useful if no or an unsuitable system setting is "
"found for NAME_prefill."
msgstr "Prefilled value za  naziv field od OpenPGP certifikati. ovaj will override naziv_prefill. It je useful if nema ili an unsuitable system postavka je found za naziv_prefill."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:111
#, kde-format
msgid "Default validity period"
msgstr "Default valjanost period"

#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:112
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Specifies the default validity period of new or extended OpenPGP keys in "
"days."
msgstr "Specifies  default valjanost period od novi ili extended OpenPGP ključevi u dana."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:113
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This setting specifies how many days an OpenPGP key will be valid by default "
"at creation or change of validity, or, in other words, after how many days "
"the key will expire. Set this to 0 for unlimited validity. If this setting "
"is not set or is set to a negative value, then new or extended OpenPGP keys "
"will be valid for three years (possibly clamped to the allowed minimum or "
"maximum validity period) by default."
msgstr "ovaj postavka specifies how many dana an OpenPGP ključ will be valjan prema default at creation ili promijeni od valjanost, ili, u other words, after how many dana  ključ will expire. postavi ovaj u 0 za unlimited valjanost. If ovaj postavka je nije postavi ili je postavi u a negative value, then novi ili extended OpenPGP ključevi will be valjan za three years (possibly clamped u  allowed minimum ili najveći valjanost period) prema default."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:117
#, kde-format
msgid "Minimum validity period"
msgstr "Minimum valjanost period"

#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:118
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Specifies the minimum allowed validity period of new or extended OpenPGP "
"keys in days."
msgstr "Specifies  minimum allowed valjanost period od novi ili extended OpenPGP ključevi u dana."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:119
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This setting specifies the minimum number of days a user can choose for the "
"validity period of OpenPGP certificates. It applies at key creation and "
"change of validity."
msgstr "ovaj postavka specifies  minimum broj od dana a korisnik can odaberi za  valjanost period od OpenPGP certifikati. It applies at ključ creation i promijeni od valjanost."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:123
#, kde-format
msgid "Maximum validity period"
msgstr "najveći valjanost period"

#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:124
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum allowed validity period of new or extended OpenPGP "
"keys in days."
msgstr "Specifies  najveći allowed valjanost period od novi ili extended OpenPGP ključevi u dana."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:125
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This setting specifies the maximum number of days a user can choose for the "
"validity period of OpenPGP certificates. It applies at key creation and "
"change of validity. If this setting is not set or is set to a negative "
"value, then unlimited validity is allowed."
msgstr "ovaj postavka specifies  najveći broj od dana a korisnik can odaberi za  valjanost period od OpenPGP certifikati. It applies at ključ creation i promijeni od valjanost. If ovaj postavka je nije postavi ili je postavi u a negative value, then unlimited valjanost je allowed."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:129
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide advanced settings"
msgstr "Poništeno."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (CertificateCreationWizard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:130
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If true, hides the advanced settings button in the new certificate wizard."
msgstr "If true, hides  advanced postavke button u  novi certifikat wizard."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Certification)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:136
#, kde-format
msgid "Default certification validity"
msgstr "Brisanje Certifikata Neuspješno"

#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry, group (Certification)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:137
#, kde-format
msgid "Specifies the default validity of certifications in days."
msgstr "Specifies  default valjanost od certifications u dana."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Certification)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:138
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This setting specifies how many days a certification is valid by default, "
"or, in other words, after how many days a new certification will expire. Set "
"this to 0 for unlimited validity of certifications."
msgstr "ovaj postavka specifies how many dana a certifikacija je valjan prema default, ili, u other words, after how many dana a novi certifikacija will expire. postavi ovaj u 0 za unlimited valjanost od certifications."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ChecksumDefinitionId), group (ChecksumOperations)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:144
#, kde-format
msgid "Checksum program to use when creating checksum files"
msgstr "Checksum program u use when creating checksum datoteke"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ShowResultsAfterSigningClipboard), group (Clipboard)
#: src/kcfg/settings.kcfg:150
#, kde-format
